"@ | Out-File -Encoding utf8 .gitignore
✅ Option 3: Git Bash se
bash
cat > .gitignore << 'EOF'
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv/
.venv/
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
.env
.env.local
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite3
.pytest_cache/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.pem
*.key
!README.md
!LICENSE
!.gitkeep
!.env.example
EOF
🚀 AB GIT MEIN ADD KARO
.gitignore banane ke baad ye commands chalao:

powershell
# 1. Status check karo
git status

# 2. .gitignore add karo
git add .gitignore

# 3. Commit karo
git commit -m "chore: add comprehensive .gitignore for Python, Node, DB, secrets"

# 4. Push karo
git push
🔍 VERIFY KARO — Kya .gitignore Sahi Kaam Kar Raha Hai?
Test 1: .env file ignored hai?
powershell
# .env file banao test ke liye
New-Item -Path .env -ItemType File

# Check karo git ignore kar raha hai ya nahi
git status
Output mein .env nahi dikhna chahiye ✅ — matlab ignore ho raha hai.

Test file delete kar do:

powershell
Remove-Item .env
Test 2: node_modules ignored hai?
Agar frontend/node_modules folder hai toh:

powershell
git status
node_modules nahi dikhna chahiye ✅

Test 3: Kaun kaun si files ignored hain?
powershell
git status --ignored
Ye saari ignored files dikhayega.

⚠️ IMPORTANT — Agar Files Already Committed Hain
Agar tune already kuch files commit kar di jo ignore honi chahiye thi (jaise .env, *.db, node_modules), toh .gitignore add karne se wo automatically remove nahi hongi. Ye chalao:

powershell
# Cache clear karo (files local rahengi, sirf git tracking hategi)
git rm -r --cached .

# Phir sab add karo (ab .gitignore apply hoga)
git add .

# Commit karo
git commit -m "chore: apply .gitignore rules to untrack unwanted files"

# Push karo
git push
📋 QUICK REFERENCE — Kya Ignore Hota Hai
Type	Ignored?	Example
Python cache	✅	__pycache__/
Virtual env	✅	venv/, .venv/
Node modules	✅	node_modules/
Build output	✅	dist/, build/
Environment vars	✅	.env
Secrets/keys	✅	*.pem, *.key
Database files	✅	*.db, *.sqlite3
Logs	✅	*.log, logs/
IDE config	✅	.vscode/, .idea/
OS files	✅	.DS_Store, Thumbs.db
README.md	❌ Keep	Tracked
LICENSE	❌ Keep	Tracked
.gitignore	❌ Keep	Tracked
.env.example	❌ Keep	Tracked (template)
.gitkeep	❌ Keep	Tracked (empty folders)
