Bhai, ye ek comprehensive .gitignore hai — Python (backend) + Node/React (frontend) + Database + IDE + OS + Secrets — sab cover karta hai. Isko apne project ke root mein .gitignore naam se save kar do.

✅ FULL .gitignore FILE
gitignore
# ==========================================================
#  AgentVerse — Multi-Agent Enterprise AI Marketplace
#  .gitignore (Root level)
# ==========================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------
#  🐍 PYTHON / BACKEND
# ----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
ENV/
.venv/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
.env/
pythonenv*/

# PyInstaller
*.manifest
*.spec

# Unit test / coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints

# mypy / pyre / pytype
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json
.pyre/
.pytype/

# Celery
celerybeat-schedule
celerybeat.pid

# SageMath
*.sage.py

# ==========================================================
#  🟩 NODE / FRONTEND (React + Vite)
# ==========================================================
node_modules/
node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.js
.pnp.cjs

# Vite
.vite/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local

# Production build
build/
out/

# Testing
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Package manager locks (keep whichever you use, ignore others)
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*

# Optional npm cache
.npm
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
.parcel-cache

# ==========================================================
#  🗄️ DATABASE (SQLite + PostgreSQL dumps)
# ==========================================================
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.psql
*.pgdump
*.dump

# SQLite temp
*-journal
*-wal
*-shm

# ==========================================================
#  🔐 ENVIRONMENT / SECRETS  ⚠️ NEVER COMMIT
# ==========================================================
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.development.local
.env.test
.env.test.local
.env.production
.env.production.local
.env.*.local

# Secrets
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer

# Google / API keys (extra safety)
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*api-keys*.json

# ==========================================================
#  📝 LOGS
# ==========================================================
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
debug.log
error.log

# ==========================================================
#  💻 IDE / EDITOR
# ==========================================================
# VS Code
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.example

# JetBrains (PyCharm, WebStorm, IntelliJ)
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
out/

# Sublime
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# Vim / Neovim
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.*.swp

# Emacs
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# Eclipse
.classpath
.project
.settings/
bin/

# ==========================================================
#  🖥️ OPERATING SYSTEMS
# ==========================================================
