📄 Complete .gitignore for AgentVerse
Bhai, ye ek comprehensive .gitignore hai — Python (backend) + Node/React (frontend) + Database + IDE + OS + Secrets — sab cover karta hai. Isko apne project ke root mein .gitignore naam se save kar do.

