✅ Apne project root mein .gitignore file banao (C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-marketplace\.gitignore)

✅ Content paste karke save karo

✅ Ye commands chalao:

powershell
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "chore: add comprehensive .gitignore"
git push
✅ GitHub refresh karo — .gitignore updated dikhega

